^D[33mDescription:[39m
  Start an interactive Paider chat session in the current project.

[33mUsage:[39m
  chat

[33mOptions:[39m
  [32m-h, --help[39m            Display help for the given command. When no command is given display help for the [32mchat[39m command
  [32m    --silent[39m          Do not output any message
  [32m-q, --quiet[39m           Only errors are displayed. All other output is suppressed
  [32m-V, --version[39m         Display this application version
  [32m    --ansi|--no-ansi[39m  Force (or disable --no-ansi) ANSI output
  [32m-n, --no-interaction[39m  Do not ask any interactive question
  [32m    --env[=ENV][39m       The environment the command should run under
  [32m-v|vv|vvv, --verbose[39m  Increase the verbosity of messages: 1 for normal output, 2 for more verbose output and 3 for debug
